  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Heavenly Court in Central Continent, an old white tower stands among white jade halls, conspicuous among empty tranquil courts. Its name is Heaven Overseeing; as the name suggests, one can observe the whole world from it. Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord climbs the stairs while spending immortal essence, and pictures on the walls show those who have escaped the judgment of fate.",
      "chapters": [
        780
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_heaven_overseeing_tower_lord"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Its most important core is Fate Gu. At the tower peak, Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord faces that Gu as a black and white spider with a scarlet wound that nearly cuts it in two. The wound was inflicted by Red Lotus Demon Venerable, who broke Fate without destroying it completely. After generations of Heavenly Court work the Gu is dying but barely usable, and those wall pictures appear because of that partial recovery. Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s arrangements used Fate Gu as the core that helped Heavenly Court resist three Demon Venerables.",
      "chapters": [
        780
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fate-gu-core",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_fate_gu",
        "char_red_lotus_demon_venerable",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Overseeing Tower carries over three million years of history, with a huge refinement path Gu formation built around it. Four rank eight Gu Immortals endure the inflow of heaven’s will for several hundred days and succeed, leaving the red wound on Fate Gu already shrunk by thirty percent. Lian Jiu Sheng says the Gu can now use fifty percent of its strength and can start to show some effect even outside Heaven Overseeing Tower, and Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord says that at half strength it is already making the world adjust itself, so that those who derailed from their path start to move back towards their original fate.",
      "chapters": [
        948
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "repairing-fate",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_lian_jiu_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Split in half by Sword Immortal Bo Qing’s escaping sword light, Heaven Overseeing Tower loses only the Gu worms nearest the cut, since its rank nine defense keeps the wider house from grave damage.",
      "chapters": [
        960
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "surviving-the-sword-light",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bo_qing",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deducing on the tower’s stairs costs Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord double the immortal essence per step it once did, and past a hundred steps the wall goes uniformly black, showing no more images.",
      "chapters": [
        966
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "an-unseen-hand-blocks-the-tower",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Overseeing Tower’s beam breaks apart the ten extreme immortal zombie lifeless formation like a rotten branch, instantly killing the last two Southern Border rank eight Gu Immortals and the escaping rank eight Great Strength True Martial immortal zombie.",
      "chapters": [
        969
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "breaking-the-ten-extreme-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_great_strength_true_martial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Overseeing Tower’s light pillar has already been whittled down by the ten extreme immortal zombie lifeless formation, leaving its might reduced.",
      "chapters": [
        971
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "whittled-down-beforehand",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Yi Tian Mountain, Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord uses the tower to deduce that the person inside Graceful Chaotic Duel Stage is otherworldly demon Gu Yue Fang Yuan, then orders Heavenly Court forces to activate the tower against Shadow Sect’s ten extreme immortal zombie lifeless formation. Heaven Overseeing Tower, at rank nine, activates fully and turns the sky white. The move activates Fate Immortal Gu and carries the power of fate: three nearby Shadow Sect Immortal Gu Houses break apart, and the rest are heavily damaged.",
      "chapters": [
        1004
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "combat-activation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "house_graceful_chaotic_duel_stage",
        "fac_gu_yue_clan",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The tower’s phantom form is not easy to activate, demanding heavy thoughts and concentration, and the six Heavenly Court rank eight Gu Immortals in charge of it turn it phantom twice and are left breathing heavily in exhaustion.",
      "chapters": [
        1012
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "combat-activation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "While Heaven Overseeing Tower gathers its strongest attack a second time against Shadow Sect’s ten extreme immortal zombie lifeless formation, a traitor of a thousand years inside Heavenly Court acts from within the tower and temporarily destroys that attacking method, leaving the tower shaking and heavily damaged. Heaven Overseeing Tower Lord reports forty percent of Heaven Overseeing Tower destroyed and the attack unusable again without the tower breaking apart.",
      "chapters": [
        1005
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "forty-percent-destroyed",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court pays that price because the lord has already deduced Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s attempt to defy heaven and resurrect. When Ying Wu Xie puts successive tower lords into dream realms, Heavenly Court fields Embroidered Tower as a second house; Spectral Soul’s ghostly hand later grabs Heaven Overseeing Tower and cracks it under rising force.",
      "chapters": [
        1010
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-assault",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "char_ying_wu_xie",
        "house_embroidered_tower"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Overseeing Tower had already set the situation before Shadow Sect could summon the rockman Gu Immortal Shi Nu, leaving Shadow Sect too busy to call on him.",
      "chapters": [
        1026
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "already-set-the-situation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shi_nu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Overseeing Tower’s strongest method, Fate Vanquish, floods the world in white light with no way to dodge for anyone below rank nine; when Duke Long calls on it against Zuo Ye Hui, the light clears half the battlefield, righteous and demonic Gu Immortals alike coughing blood and taking instant heavy injuries, most of them fainting on the spot, except those a dream realm shields.",
      "chapters": [
        1359
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fate-vanquishs-reach",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_fate_vanquish",
        "char_duke_long",
        "char_zuo_ye_hui"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Turned phantom to dodge Zuo Ye Hui, Heaven Overseeing Tower still has a corner devoured when Duke Long brings it near a dream realm, since only a house with dream path Immortal Gu can resist getting lost inside one.",
      "chapters": [
        1360
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "phantom-form-fails-in-a-dream-realm",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Overseeing Tower moves through white heaven carrying Duke Long, Fairy Zi Wei, and other Gu Immortals of the ten great ancient sects into the battle, obstructed on the way by Purple Mountain True Monarch’s methods.",
      "chapters": [
        1366
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "into-the-battle-through-white-heaven",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deadlocked with Zuo Ye Hui and both sides injured, Heaven Overseeing Tower’s edges break apart, no longer as grand as before.",
      "chapters": [
        1370
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "edges-breaking-apart",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fate Gu is destroyed, cracks spread through Heaven Overseeing Tower and the whole house crumbles into fragments that fall with Gu Immortal corpses. Duke Long later says Heavenly Court spent three million years researching a killer move to make use of Fate Gu, and asks whether others know how to construct Heaven Overseeing Tower.",
      "chapters": [
        1961
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "house-collapse",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "res_gu_immortal_corpse"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Ding Ling says nobody can cultivate heaven path, and that Heavenly Court created the tower to make use of Fate Gu. Fate Gu cannot be used by anyone, but the tower unleashes a portion of its might.",
      "chapters": [
        2028
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "design-purpose",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_ding_ling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Overseeing Tower is the most famous Gu House; with rank nine Fate Gu destroyed it cannot be constructed again.",
      "chapters": [
        2253
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "reconstruction-limit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_house"
      ]
    }
  ],
